(RFC-9901: LOCALSHIFT CORE CONVERSION ARCHITECTURE) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. Introduction) Tj
T* (This specification defines the offline file conversion architecture for LocalShift.) Tj
T* (The system is engineered for deterministic, privacy-first local processing on Windows.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1.1 Design Goals) Tj
T* (The conversion pipeline adheres to three primary design goals:) Tj
T* (- 100% offline local CPU execution without network dependencies.) Tj
T* (- Preservation of original document layout and character semantics.) Tj
T* (- Cooperative cancellation and strict memory bounds.) Tj
ET
endstream
