(2. Adapter Lifecycle and Routing) Tj
T* (All document conversions are mediated by the ConversionAdapter protocol.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2.1 Preflight Validation) Tj
T* (Before execution, the planner verifies the existence, format, and size of the input.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2.2 Resource Attribution) Tj
T* (Process execution is monitored for memory footprint and page count limits.) Tj
T* (Maximum pages processed per document shall not exceed 2000 pages.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
